--- task
id: s03
dataset: social
kind: two aggregates over one traversal
answer: fewest

--- intent
For each comment author, return their slug, how many of their comments someone liked as `liked_comments`, and how many likes their comments received in total as `likes`.

--- edition2
query author_engagement() {
  match { $c: Comment  $c commentHasCreator $a  $p likesComment $c }
  return { $a.slug, count(distinct $c) as liked_comments, count($p) as likes }
}

--- edition3
query author_engagement() {
  match { $c: Comment  $c commentHasCreator $a  $p likesComment $c }
  return { $a.slug, count(distinct $c) as liked_comments, count($p) as likes }
}

--- expect unordered
columns: ["a.slug","liked_comments","likes"]
